  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ravi Kant Mishra vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. Of ... on 21 November, 2024 Author: Alok Mathur Bench: Alok Mathur High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ? Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:76892 Court No. - 6 Case :- Writ - A No. - 10826 of 2024 Petitioner :- Ravi Kant Mishra Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. Of Food And Civil Supply Lko And An Counsel for Petitioner :- Abhishek Tiwari,Anuj Kudesia,Rishabh Chauhan Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Alok Mathur,J. 1.",
    "facts": "It seems that there are several allegations with regard to sub standard food grains being supplied to Ravi Kant Mishra vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Deptt. Of ... on 21 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/31194653/ 1 fair price shops which is not fit for human consumption since July, 2024 and looking into various complaints even the local MLA has raised the said issue before the competent authority which led the government officials to look into the matter and conduct a preliminary inquiry into the food-grains. The preliminary inquiry was got conducted by a team consisting with Supply Inspector, Marketing Inspector, Food Safety Officials, who found that between 40 to 60 bags of wheat food-grains which was not fit for human consumption had been dispatched to various fair price shops for distribution. In the preliminary inquiry report the role of the petitioner was also highlighted and it is for the said reason that District Magistrate, Shahjahanpur after considering the preliminary inquiry report had issued a direction on 15.10.2024 to take action against all the persons responsible and to suspend them and also to initiate disciplinary proceedings. It is in pursuance of the order of the District Magistrate that the petitioner by means of the impugned order dated 19.10.2024 has been suspended.",
    "arguments": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioner has vehemently submitted that the petitioner is not involved at any stage and the allegations of the preliminary report does not record any finding involving petitioner and also that the order for holding inquiry in the said matter has been passed without any application of mind."
  },
